ntry music i grew up in  texas so yeah gotta listen to country  music and um a bunch of random things  yeah who in your life is uh most proud  of you right now probably my best friend  yeah yeah my best friend ashley back  home in texas we've been best friends  since  the sixth grade and even though she  doesn't say it i like to think she's  proud of me is this sort of when you are  so close as you are with ashley was this  sort of like a shared dream between the  two of you where she sort of feels like  she's living it a little too  no we we never had any dreams of this  like i was writing songs in my bedroom  just because i liked it and i didn't  have any  idea of how anything could ever happen  to to dream of it would have been  foolish and it happened  completely unexpected to me  you

